# Firebase Admin service account keys. *.key above does not catch these —
# they are .json, and Google's default download name is a long
# <project>-firebase-adminsdk-<hash>.json. Committing one grants full
# database and storage access to anyone who can read the repo.
*serviceAccount*.json
*service-account*.json
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
firebase-adminsdk-*.json
